> Any update on this? I encounter this issue too. It appears gdscript loading consume most time. And setting GDScript export mode to text will make it faster. Maybe it is related to remap?

@abcjjy I'm assuming #105852 is the issue you're talking about? If so, I don't think it's related to this specific issue, as mentioned in [my comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105852#issuecomment-2834598804) there.

@bruvzg Any chance you'd have time in the near future to fully explore your proposed solution of bundling the directory structure at export time? I've been meaning to look at this issue myself, but haven't found the time yet. I'm also not sure I understand your solution clearly enough to implement it fully right now.
